{"tmdb":1391021,"tagline":"Eat well, stay alive.","synopsis":"Seeking a fresh start, chef Xu Fu travels to the Middle East to support his family and repay his debts. Alongside restaurant manager Ma Junsheng, he transforms the struggling Dragon Restaurant into a thriving business. But when war engulfs the city, their hard-won success is shattered and the restaurant becomes a refuge for those caught in the conflict. As danger closes in, Xu Fu must risk everything to protect his newfound community and preserve a small beacon of hope amid the devastation.","directors":[{"name":"Wen Muye","id":1958907}],"cast":[{"actor":"Shen Teng","role":"Xu Fu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/h9l1fHqty8EdCqDWNWjO5tp48xZ.jpg","tmdb":1519026},{"actor":"Jiang Qiming","role":"Ma Junsheng","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6OWIhJwjwiMWKBHcUTn7pglXEFx.jpg","tmdb":3863054},{"actor":"Omar Sherif","role":"Seif","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/iSiOazDKO0tIChVnn79oJJGYTHp.jpg","tmdb":3361500},{"actor":"Sherif Sobhy","role":"Zaid","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/v5wKJ0LOrYWE5PtyiSHoGwtvNYb.jpg","tmdb":3172812},{"actor":"Wei Qing","role":"Xu's Mother","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/on1BVc4NJwK03fToeMDGJl6d0Ad.jpg","tmdb":1875563},{"actor":"Zhang Xiwei","role":"Xu Le","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dVUef87Q5Gc0X8yEcGPU9PchwP9.jpg","tmdb":3230522},{"actor":"Aarif Rahman","role":"Tony","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xIhutO65mdNEWKHusfvHZYTDITE.jpg","tmdb":148881},{"actor":"Russell Shealy","role":"Morgan","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i5Dsun5rSHEMycSarzNenKAtapu.jpg","tmdb":2979283},{"actor":"Tanner Hagen","role":"Joel Brady","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8rWlVnVE9kq5VO7lareI0dgTl5J.jpg","tmdb":3471406},{"actor":"Jason Paul Field","role":"Peter","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A8YCSlmhHjqpRiPKryYUPOUi01o.jpg","tmdb":176719},{"actor":"Travis Lincoln Cox","role":"Eric","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/i